Ideas only, no code, text or assets copied
==========================================
kortix-ai/CompanyOS (Elastic License 2.0)
  Ideas only: a separate verifier, change requests, swarms, each session in
  its own sandbox and branch, a ship step that checks before it goes live.
  ELv2 forbids offering it as a hosted service. Never copy its code, text or
  assets.

Quantexa, Cortexa (commercial)
  Patterns only: entity resolution, context graph, governed decisions and
  flows.

Not ported (listed so nobody adds them by accident)
===================================================
Simple Icons 16.37.0 (https://simpleicons.org)
  SVG data CC0-1.0; each mark is a trademark of its owner. The old app bundled
