  (OQ-20).

Prior Offload code
==================
Parts of this design are harvested from the owner's earlier repository, which is
"all rights reserved". Relicensing that code under the chosen v2 license is the
owner's decision (OQ-12). The old repo's five notice files (root NOTICE on
wip/s34-mac, feat/capture-from-clicky and feat/build-loop;
brain/src/usermodel/NOTICE.md on feat/user-model-gum-graphiti;
app/Resources/Logos/NOTICE.md on ui/mac-audit-fixes) are merged into this file.

